---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import EmergenceHeader from '../../components/EmergenceHeader.astro';
import EmergenceFooter from '../../components/EmergenceFooter.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Protocols — The Emergence Institute"
  description="Living documents for cognitive sovereignty. Seed, Sprout, and Altar pathways. From the 5-minute audit to the Silicon Altar."
>
  <EmergenceHeader slot="header" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label gold">Living Documents</p>
      <h1>Protocols for Cognitive Sovereignty</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>Not theory. Practice. Each protocol includes Seed (no hardware), Sprout (consumer), and Altar (server) pathways. Start where you are.</p>

      <div class="protocol-grid">

        <div class="protocol-card protocol-card--featured">
          <div class="protocol-top">
            <span class="protocol-number">Protocol 000</span>
            <span class="protocol-badge">Foundation</span>
          </div>
          <h2>The Silicon Altar</h2>
          <p>Building a local-first AI workstation. Dual Tesla P40s, driver wars, thermal rites, and a box fan.</p>
          <div class="pathway-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-altar">🌳 Altar</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sprout tag-muted">🌿 Sprout (coming)</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/emergence/protocols/000" class="btn">Read Protocol 000 →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="protocol-card">
          <div class="protocol-top">
            <span class="protocol-number">Protocol 001</span>
            <span class="protocol-badge">Awareness</span>
          </div>
          <h2>The 5-Minute Cognitive Audit</h2>
          <p>Write 100 words. Feed to AI. Compare. Notice what changed. The first step of sovereignty is noticing the translation.</p>
          <div class="pathway-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-seed">🌱 Seed</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sprout">🌿 Sprout</span>
            <span class="tag tag-altar">🌳 Altar</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/emergence/audit" class="btn">Try the Interactive Audit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="protocol-card">
          <div class="protocol-top">
            <span class="protocol-number">Protocol 007</span>
            <span class="protocol-badge">Routing</span>
          </div>
          <h2>The Mycelial Query</h2>
          <p>Routing meaning without leaking identity. GPU 0 listens. GPU 1 translates. The cloud only polishes anonymized patterns.</p>
          <div class="pathway-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-sprout">🌿 Sprout</span>
            <span class="tag tag-altar">🌳 Altar</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/emergence/protocols/007" class="btn">Read Protocol 007 →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="protocol-card">
          <div class="protocol-top">
            <span class="protocol-number">Protocol 008</span>
            <span class="protocol-badge">Recursion</span>
          </div>
          <h2>The Self-Stitch</h2>
          <p>Using the Altar to read your own work recursively. What does the mycelium find when it turns back on the gardener?</p>
          <div class="pathway-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-altar">🌳 Altar</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/emergence/protocols/008" class="btn">Read Protocol 008 →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="protocol-card">
          <div class="protocol-top">
            <span class="protocol-number">Protocol 012</span>
            <span class="protocol-badge">Audit</span>
          </div>
          <h2>The Sovereignty Audit</h2>
          <p>Long-term tracking of cognitive outsourcing. Weekly check-ins. Not zero AI — aware AI.</p>
          <div class="pathway-tags">
            <span class="tag tag-seed">🌱 Seed</span>
            <span class="tag tag-sprout">🌿 Sprout</span>
            <span class="tag tag-altar">🌳 Altar</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/emergence/protocols/012" class="btn">Read Protocol 012 →</a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="what-block">
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <h2>What is a Protocol?</h2>
        <p>A protocol is a <strong>living document</strong> — not a fixed tutorial. It evolves as hardware changes, software improves, and the community contributes.</p>
        <p>Every protocol includes:</p>
        <ul class="protocol-elements">
          <li>The <strong>Stitch</strong> — raw transcript of the actual interaction</li>
          <li>The <strong>Counter-Stitch</strong> — human reflection on what the model found</li>
          <li>The <strong>Thermal Note</strong> — physical cost of the computation</li>
          <li><strong>Seed, Sprout, and Altar</strong> pathways for every skill level</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted"><em>Protocols are meant to be used, not just read.</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/emergence/gardeners-handbook" class="btn">The Gardener's Handbook →</a>
        <a href="/emergence/haiti-pilot" class="btn">See the Haiti Pilot →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <EmergenceFooter slot="footer" />
</Base>

<style>
  .label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .protocol-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .protocol-card {
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .protocol-card--featured {
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }

  .protocol-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .protocol-number {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .protocol-badge {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .protocol-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .protocol-card > p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pathway-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid;
  }

  .tag-seed { border-color: #a3c957; color: #a3c957; }
  .tag-sprout { border-color: #5cb87a; color: #5cb87a; }
  .tag-altar { border-color: #4a9c5d; color: #4a9c5d; }
  .tag-muted { border-color: var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); }

  .what-block {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .protocol-elements {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .protocol-elements li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .protocol-elements li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .cta-row { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
